## Types

### PdfPageOrientation

```ts
type PdfPageOrientation = 'portrait' | 'landscape';
```

### PdfPageSize

```ts
type PdfPageSize =
    | 'A4'
    | 'Letter'
    | {
          width: number;
          height: number;
      };
```

### PdfFontFamily

```ts
type PdfFontFamily =
    | 'Helvetica'
    | 'Helvetica-Bold'
    | 'Times-Roman'
    | 'Times-Bold'
    | 'Courier'
    | 'Courier-Bold';
```
